# What Vercel must NOT upload for a build.
#
# Added 2026-09-09 (plan 09-08) after `vercel --prod` began failing with
# "Upload aborted": committing six Lighthouse reports put ~3 MB of JSON in the
# upload set and the deploy stopped completing. None of it is read by
# `next build` or by anything at runtime.
#
# The size was the symptom. The real point is that planning artifacts, evidence
# documents and brand source files have no business on a build machine — this
# repository keeps its working notes next to its code, and without this file
# every one of them was being shipped to the edge on every deploy.
#
# Keep this list to things that are provably build-irrelevant. `public/` holds
# the served assets (favicon, OG image) and is deliberately absent below.

.planning/
docs/
logo/

# Local-only test and tooling output.
coverage/
test-results/
playwright-report/
